1
00:00:00,116 --> 00:00:01,406
(Raj:)Okay. Uh...

2
00:00:01,576 --> 00:00:03,616
Oh, hey, how about her?

3
00:00:04,329 --> 00:00:07,039
Sure, if he wants to spend years
doing her homework...

4
00:00:07,207 --> 00:00:10,417
(Leonard:)...while she drinks herself into a stupor
with nonfat White Russians.

5
00:00:10,585 --> 00:00:13,005
And you're holding her head
while she's puking...

6
00:00:13,171 --> 00:00:15,381
...and wishes more guys were like you.

7
00:00:15,548 --> 00:00:17,888
(Leonard:)She gets into Cornell,
because you wrote her essay.

8
00:00:18,051 --> 00:00:22,261
(Leonard:)And you drive up to visit her one weekend
and she acts like she doesn't know you.

9
00:00:24,849 --> 00:00:26,599
(Raj:)Okay, so not her either.

10
00:00:28,269 --> 00:00:29,649
(Raj:)How about her?

11
00:00:29,813 --> 00:00:33,693
(Howard:)Interesting, kind of pretty, a little chubby,
so probably low self-esteem.

12
00:00:33,858 --> 00:00:34,938
(Leonard:)I think that's our girl.

13
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:36,740
(Leonard:)One of us should go talk to her.

14
00:00:36,903 --> 00:00:38,693
(Raj:)I can't talk to her, you do it.

15
00:00:38,863 --> 00:00:40,823
(Leonard:)I can't just go up and talk to her.

16
00:00:40,991 --> 00:00:42,161
(Leonard:)Howard, you talk to her.

17
00:00:43,034 --> 00:00:46,704
I don't know, she'll never go for the kid
once she gets a peek at this.

18
00:00:48,873 --> 00:00:50,453
(Raj:)In India, this would be simpler.

19
00:00:50,625 --> 00:00:53,835
Five minutes with her dad, 20 goats
and a laptop, and we'd be done.

20
00:00:54,462 --> 00:00:55,712
(Leonard:)Well, we're not in India.

21
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,630
(Raj:)Why don't we do it your way, then?

